{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063346/block/singleImage/3264903/df/01M76BSG1AC87RF81DY9AQT5HD.jpg?updatedAt=1794436425\"/><figcaption>跨部門油尖掃黃及打擊黑工，共拘31男女。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>警方表示，油尖區警員聯同相關部門人員昨日(11日)在區內展開打擊非法勞工及掃黃行動，突擊搜查區內多個地點，共拘捕31人。行動中，警方共拘捕24名內地女子、2名內地男子、3名非華裔男子及2名非華裔女子，年齡介乎21至54歲，他們分別涉嫌「逾期居留」、「違反逗留條件」及「非法勞工」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，部分被捕人稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.951975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:17:11.654727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.821858+00:00","content_hash":"3a308476dc6ec34652beeda98def7bbd22eb2f095daf2ba1e97f30b35daab9e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.951975+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}